<title>BRAZIL: Banco do Brasil first half results due Mon.</title>
<headline>Banco do Brasil first half results due Mon.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian government bank Banco do Brasil will announce its first half results next Monday, a bank spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>After heavy losses in 1995 and 1996, the bank posted a 155.29 million real net profit between January and May.</p>
<p>(( -- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
